#: b7841f98976b4d049ddcb2ca62e35b5e d0b45720281d4f408aba7366352a97c7
msgid ""
"The lidar should be mounted horizontally on the top or bottom of the vehicle"
" with the arrow on top of the unit pointing towards the front of the "
"vehicle. Ensure the sensor's view is not obstructed by any portion of the "
"vehicle including GPS mast, vehicle legs etc."
msgstr ""
"激光雷达应水平安装在飞行器顶部或底部，设备顶部的箭头朝向飞行器前方。确保传感器视野不被飞行器任何部分遮挡，包括 GPS 桅杆、飞行器支腿等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:38 c15b256a4e3b4964ad25e4a2854f2954
msgid ""
"The lidar can be connected to the autopilot's serial input as shown above. "
"If using a Pixhawk/Pixhawk2 Telem1 (aka Serial1) should be used because it "
"is more capable of providing the required power."
msgstr ""
"激光雷达可如上图所示连接到飞控的串口输入。如果使用 Pixhawk/Pixhawk2，应使用 Telem1（即 Serial1），因为其供电能力更强。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:41 23d341ae1d294a96a9d86c3f9588dd0f
#: 81978e9ba5ec411a8c89e769c9b28d00 c700773568824948b353faa506f7631a
#: da7212c79edc41128188823c3b8487cd eaf375ee55c74f4696e16f157531ea85
msgid ""
"only the Lidar's TX pin is used. Its pwm motor control input pin is not "
"connected and the lidar will spin at a default rate (reported in its "
"telemetry back to the autopilot)."
msgstr "仅使用激光雷达的 TX 引脚，其 PWM 电机控制输入引脚不连接，激光雷达将以默认速率旋转（通过数传反馈给飞控）。"

