#: f2d5334d5de34d66ac1a8cba2ff098e4
msgid ""
"The lidar can be connected to the autopilot's serial input as shown above. "
"If using a Pixhawk/Pixhawk 2.1 (CubePilot CubeBlack) Telem1 (aka Serial1) "
"should be used because it is more capable of providing the required power."
msgstr ""
"激光雷达可按上图所示连接到飞控的串口输入。如果使用 Pixhawk/Pixhawk 2.1（CubePilot CubeBlack），应使用 "
"Telem1（即 Serial1），因为它更能提供所需的供电。"
